      "writtenOn": "2025-04-07T19:16:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "WDYT of keeping a map to a struct that has both the `lowestWaitSerial` and a `vector` of indices into the `futures` vector? We could pass the struct into `WaitQueueSerialsImpl` and avoid iterating over the entire list of futures for every device in that way.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 197,
        "startChar": 36,
        "endLine": 197,
        "endChar": 51
      },
      "revId": "280a3e03861a01199a21a06e500fe4f6c4b5cb21",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
